---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Edge AI Tutor Sandbox | Miller Arias"
  description="Edge AI Tutor Sandbox: Miller Arias' project on edge AI, with model integration and local processing."
>
  <!-- Main Container with page transitions -->
  <main
    class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-16 md:mt-24"
    transition:name="card-project-edge"
  >
    <!-- Back button -->
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-3 text-sm font-mono text-neutral-500 hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors group"
    >
      <span class="inline-block transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform">
        ←
      </span>
      Back to home
    </a>

    <!-- PROJECT HEADER -->
    <header class="mb-12 mt-11">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
          Research Thesis
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full">
          100% Offline / Local CPU
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-100 mb-6">
        Edge AI Tutor Sandbox
      </h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Hybrid architecture for isolated code evaluation, local RAG, and
        quantized AI aimed at mitigating logical hallucination and cognitive
        distractions in educational environments.
      </p>
    </header>

    <hr class="border-neutral-900 my-12" />

    <!-- END-TO-END FLOW DIAGRAM (Pure HTML & CSS) -->
    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        End-to-End Data Flow
      </h2>

      <div class="flow-diagram bg-neutral-900/30 border border-neutral-900 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/50">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            1
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold">Frontend (index.html)</p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              Structured submission via FormData (prevents prompt injection).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center text-neutral-500 text-lg leading-none">▼</div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/50">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/10 text-yellow-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            2
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold">
              FastAPI Core Engine (main.py)
            </p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              Receives the .py binary and persists transactions in SQLite
              (Gating).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center text-neutral-500 text-lg leading-none">▼</div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/50">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            3
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold">
              Hermetic Docker Sandbox (Orchestrator)
            </p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              Isolated execution (3s max) against hidden Pytest. Extracts JSON.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center text-neutral-500 text-lg leading-none">▼</div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/50">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            4
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold">
              Local RAG Engine (ChromaDB + Ollama)
            </p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              Cross-references the error with teacher notes. Inference with Qwen
              2.5 Coder 3B.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center text-neutral-500 text-lg leading-none">▼</div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-900 rounded-xl text-emerald-400">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            ✓
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold">Output Guardrail & Socratic Feedback</p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              Censors direct code via the backend and delivers logical hints.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- API TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION -->
    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Core Endpoint Specification
      </h2>
      <div class="bg-neutral-900 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-950 border-b border-neutral-800 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold">
            POST
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-mono text-neutral-300">/evaluar</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 ml-auto">
            multipart/form-data
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain">
          <table class="w-full text-left font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 min-w-[500px]">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800 text-neutral-500">
                <th class="pb-2 font-normal">Parameter</th>
                <th class="pb-2 font-normal">Type</th>
                <th class="pb-2 font-normal">Description</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                <td class="py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-200">student_id</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-cyan-400">string</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">
                  Unique student identifier.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                <td class="py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-200">exercise_id</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-cyan-400">string</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">
                  Code of the problem to evaluate (e.g., dict_01).
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-200">file</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-purple-400">file (binary)</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">
                  Python source file (.py) developed by the student.
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- DATA MODEL & GATING STRATEGY -->
    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Strict Persistence (Anti Rote-Learning Strategy)
      </h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        To objectively measure progress and prevent students from memorizing or
        randomly guessing solutions, the relational schema in{" "}
        <strong>SQLite</strong> stores the transactional retry history
        atomically.
      </p>
      <div class="bg-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 font-mono text-xs text-cyan-400 overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain">
        <pre><code><span class="text-neutral-500">-- Incremental attempt control structure</span>
<span class="text-purple-400">CREATE TABLE</span> IF NOT EXISTS progress (
    id <span class="text-orange-400">INTEGER</span> PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    student_id <span class="text-orange-400">TEXT</span> NOT NULL,
    exercise_id <span class="text-orange-400">TEXT</span> NOT NULL,
    status <span class="text-orange-400">TEXT</span> NOT NULL,
    attempts <span class="text-orange-400">INTEGER</span> DEFAULT 1
);</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SCIENTIFIC FINDINGS AND LESSONS LEARNED -->
    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Engineering Findings & Mitigation
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-amber-500/30 pl-4">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-200 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            ⚠️ Environment Conflict: Live Reload vs Containerization
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            During testing with Uvicorn's{" "}
            <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-amber-400">
              --reload
            </code>{" "}
            flag, the physical write of files submitted by the student triggered
            the File System Watcher, restarting the server and interrupting the
            Docker container lifecycle before the JSON report could be read.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono mt-2">
            <strong>Solution:</strong> Modification of the isolated runtime
            environment for volumes or static disabling of the watcher in
            production.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-purple-500/30 pl-4">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-200 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            🧠 Reasoning Limits in Quantized Models (SLM)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Extensive testing with <strong>Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B</strong>
            demonstrated strict adherence to the Socratic format but revealed
            logical hallucinations under complex syntactic failures (e.g.,
            conceptually confusing the use of{" "}
            <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">
              .keys()
            </code>{" "}
            with{" "}
            <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">
              .values()
            </code>
            ).
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono mt-2">
            <strong>Mitigation:</strong> Restructuring of the injected prompt
            using <strong>Chain-of-Thought (CoT)</strong> architectures and
            structured <strong>Few-Shot Prompting</strong> to guide the model's
            atomic inference.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PAGE FOOTER -->
    <footer class="mt-24 pt-8 border-t border-neutral-800 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500">
        Miller Arias • Technical Project Details • 2026
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
